# webapps.list — curated webapp catalog. Name | URL | icon
# icon = a freedesktop icon name (Papirus theme, or a bundled webapp-<slug> in hicolor).
# Searchable in the launcher's Install section; drag one to the grid to install.
# A leading * on the Name = a storefront recommendation (shown on an empty
# query, blended with programs); the rest only appear when you search for them.

